    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A foolish man who could not suppress his powerful yearning to learn the forbidden knowledge that humans cannot attain, and tried to learn the dragons' magic by visiting Land Dragon Antharas alone. Antharas turned the man into a monster for disturbing his rest. Now a hideous creature, the man hates anything beautiful. He curses Antharas in private, but is truly terrified of the dragon. Giants Lv. 11 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Giants. P. Atk. +7% Max HP +7% Attack Range +15 Resistance to Shock +20% Resistance to Dagger +10% Resistance to Dual Dagger +10% Accuracy -5 Resistance to Spear -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
